# Build context of ops/docker/api.Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore): everything out, then the
# few things the image needs back in. Never a secret, a cache, a model, a report or the raw data.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!pipelines/
!db/migrations/
!Data/
Data/raw/
Data/incoming/
Data/embeddings/
Data/processed/agents/eval/llm_cache/
Data/processed/agents/tool_cache/
Data/processed/semi-structured/synthetic/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
